World "LeanAndLogic"
Title "Lean and Logic"

Introduction "
## Stage 1: Propositional Logic in Lean

This world introduces **Lean 4** as a proof assistant and covers the full
language of **propositional logic**: implication, conjunction, disjunction,
negation, and biconditional.

Along the way you will meet the logicians and mathematicians who built the
foundations this software rests on — from de Bruijn and Martin-Löf to Curry,
Howard, Gentzen, and Brouwer — and learn how their ideas live inside every
proof you write.

By the end of this world, you will have proven 12 theorems and be ready to
move on to **predicate logic**, sets, and beyond.
"
